This is not aimed at anyone in particular, but ....
Personally I think Hack will lose at lot of its "charm" or
playablility if converted to a 3D first-person EOB-style 
format.
How can you show a map of the whole level other than with a map
of the whole level? How would you implement all of the features
of Hack into one easy-to-use graphical interface? I've got 
nothing
against 3D games, but I think you won't be able to call it Hack
when you're finished converting it. Comments?






